{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 14:34:45 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase5-OutputRecorder] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1_phase5_tool_output] Phase 5 systematic tool testing initiated - discovered actual scope is 16 MCP-exposed tools (not 28) requiring 48 mode tests plus edge case validation | actual_tool_count=16; estimated_time=6-8 hours; phase=phase_5; reasoning={\"how\": \"Will test all 16 MCP-exposed tools across 3 modes (48 tests), plus edge cases, plus bug hunting for manage_docs auto-registration\", \"what\": \"Constraints: Must test ALL tools comprehensively. Available: 16 mcp__scribe__* functions confirmed. Discrepancy: Wiki INDEX says 28 but includes config classes (append_entry_config, query_entries_config, rotate_log_config), validation modules (manage_docs_validation), and utilities (agent_project_utils, project_utils, health_check) that aren't MCP-exposed tools\", \"why\": \"Phase 5 spec says 28 tools but MCP exposes 16 tools - need to clarify scope with orchestrator before exhaustive testing\"}; scope_clarification=True; total_test_cases=48; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1_phase5_tool_output/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T14:34:45.786924+00:00_e6bef9f2", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T14:34:45.786959+00:00"}
