{"op": "append", "content": "[\u274c] [2026-01-05 14:35:53 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase5-OutputRecorder] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1_phase5_tool_output] CRITICAL BUG DISCOVERED - compact mode returns identical output to structured mode for list_projects and get_project (no token reduction) | affected_tools=[\"list_projects\", \"get_project\"]; bug_type=format_parameter_broken; next_action=Document in BUG-FORMAT-001, test remaining tools for same issue; phase=phase_5; reasoning={\"how\": \"Tested both tools with format='compact' and format='structured' parameters - compared byte-for-byte outputs - found exact matches indicating compact mode not implemented for these tools\", \"what\": \"Constraints: Compact mode must reduce tokens <80% of readable. Observed: list_projects compact=666 chars vs structured=666 chars (100% identical), get_project compact=651 vs structured=651 (100% identical). Expected: compact should use short field names, omit metadata\", \"why\": \"Compact mode should reduce tokens but returns identical JSON to structured mode - defeats purpose of compact format\"}; reproduction=mcp__scribe__list_projects(format='compact') == mcp__scribe__list_projects(format='structured'); severity=high; priority=high; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1_phase5_tool_output/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T14:35:53.152785+00:00_aebc1058", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T14:35:53.152821+00:00"}
