{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 14:37:09 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1_phase5_tool_output] Phase 5 Team A deployed: Already found CRITICAL SYSTEMIC BUG - compact mode not implemented across multiple tools (list_projects, get_project, read_recent return identical JSON to structured mode). Team A testing 16 actual MCP tools (not 28 - that included non-MCP utilities). 4 tools tested so far, 12 remaining. Working in sandbox, writing deliverables to main audit wiki as designed. | actual_tool_count=16; critical_bug=BUG-FORMAT-SYSTEMIC_compact_mode_not_implemented; phase=phase_5_team_a_deployed; tools_affected=[\"list_projects\", \"get_project\", \"read_recent\"]; tools_remaining=12; tools_tested=4; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1_phase5_tool_output/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T14:37:09.033608+00:00_ee077556", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T14:37:09.033635+00:00"}
